OL,3,GNEWSAWitnesses to be called as Omagh
OL,4,ABombing Inquiry resumes
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe next phase of hearings at the Omagh
OL,7,FBombing Inquiry will begin on Monday,
OL,8,Fsix months later than scheduled.
OL,10,FTwenty-nine people, including a woman
OL,11,Fpregnant with twins, died in the
OL,12,Fbombing in the County Tyrone town on 15
OL,13,FAugust 1998 - the biggest single
OL,14,Fatrocity in the Troubles.
OL,16,FThe hearings will centre on the days
OL,17,Fimmediately before and after the
OL,18,Fatrocity and will examine how the
OL,19,Fbombing was carried out and who was
OL,20,Fresponsible.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
