OL,3,GNEWSAWitnesses to be called as Omagh
OL,4,ABombing Inquiry resumes
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe inquiry was due to resume in March
OL,7,Fand the delay was partly due to the
OL,8,Favailability and scale of material
OL,9,Fcoming from the Republic of Ireland.
